izenkova</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Pota</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Collinge</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>2009</year><article-title>Shadoo (Sprn) and prion disease incubation time in mice.</article-title><source>Mamm Genome</source></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006538-Beck1"><label>19</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Beck</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Campbell</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Adamson</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Poulter</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Uphill</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2008</year><article-title>Association of a null allele of SPRN with variant Creutzfeldt-Jakob Disease.</article-title><source>J Med Genet</source></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006538-Soldevila1"><label>20</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Soldevila</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Andres</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramirez-Soriano</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Marques-Bonet</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Calafell</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>The prion protein gene in humans revisited: lessons from a worldwide resequencing study.</article-title><source>Genome Res</source><volume>16</volume><fpage>231</fpage><lpage>239</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16369046</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006538-Orr1"><label>21</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Orr</surname><given-names>HT</given-names></nam